title: "Vanguard Host Trust: Integrity, Privilege, and Digital Trust"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Vanguard Host Trust Contributors"
abstract: >-
  An evidence-bounded system security research project examining Riot
  Vanguard's public host-trust model, privileged enforcement, platform
  requirements, and availability trade-offs, with a supporting interactive
  security demonstrator.
